    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss Paint is a puzzle platformer game that takes place inside a nostalgic computer interface where you can use image editing tools such as rotate, resize, copy, move, and rectangle to edit the levels themselves and lead Miss Paint to victory by touching the color green!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/01b9d579ad10fd81457492b821fc701a.poster.avif?t=1748635361\" width=616 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/01b9d579ad10fd81457492b821fc701a.webm?t=1748635361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/0641cb059873fa5ef94ada1bbc6a1582.avif?t=1748635361\" data-has-big width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Each color behaves in a different way!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Collect all the green to win, don't edit blue, and don't touch orange unless you want to die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 (and more!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/9c30f311bbd857930e710be199adbddf.poster.avif?t=1748635361\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/9c30f311bbd857930e710be199adbddf.webm?t=1748635361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/9839a2835210dc6b47a661a65ade63de.avif?t=1748635361\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0The game supports player built custom levels so even when you finish the main campaign\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0you'll have infinitely more content to look forward to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/7b93b4edc84b4873aa79dc6abc36d718.poster.avif?t=1748635361\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/7b93b4edc84b4873aa79dc6abc36d718.webm?t=1748635361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/7b93b4edc84b4873aa79dc6abc36d718.mp4?t=1748635361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the retro computer interface and uncover all its secrets!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/1d0cb909257505cd5cd359f558965edc.webp?t=1748635361\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
