in=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/9c30f311bbd857930e710be199adbddf.poster.avif?t=1748635361\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/9c30f311bbd857930e710be199adbddf.webm?t=1748635361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/9839a2835210dc6b47a661a65ade63de.avif?t=1748635361\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0The game supports player built custom levels so even when you finish the main campaign\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0you'll have infinitely more content to look forward to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/7b93b4edc84b4873aa79dc6abc36d718.poster.avif?t=1748635361\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/7b93b4edc84b4873aa79dc6abc36d718.webm?t=1748635361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/7b93b4edc84b4873aa79dc6abc36d718.mp4?t=1748635361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the retro computer interface and uncover all its secrets!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755990/extras/1d0cb909257505cd5cd359f558965edc.webp?t=1748635361\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
